\b SmartDock\b0\par
\par
This will install SmartDock for your Windows account only, in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\SmartDock. Administrator rights are not needed.\par
\par
\b What gets installed\b0\par
- SmartDock.exe (self-contained; .NET is not required)\par
- Start menu shortcuts: "SmartDock" and "SmartDock - Restore Windows taskbar"\par
- "Start with Windows" (you can turn this off in SmartDock > Settings)\par
\par
\b Good to know\b0\par
- If you use taskbar replacement mode, SmartDock hides the Windows taskbar and always restores it when it exits, when it is uninstalled, or via the "Restore Windows taskbar" shortcut.\par
- Your settings, layout, notes and encrypted tokens are kept in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\SmartDock and are not removed on uninstall.\par
\par
